schway-screen 1
screen grok-quota-error
title Grok usage limit
description An exhausted subscription retains its route and points to subscription usage.
variant light-120
size 120x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ▌ ! Error
  ▌ Grok usage limit reached · Check https://grok.com/?_s=usage and wait before retrying.





















